Family code
-----------

The command, the container's checks, the durable writes, the reports and
the BLAKE3 unit come from POA (https://github.com/YadeWira/POA), which took
them from PJA (https://github.com/YadeWira/PJA) by way of PMPA; all are by
the same author under the same MIT license.

BLAKE3 is by Jack O'Connor, Jean-Philippe Aumasson, Samuel Neves and Zooko
Wilcox-O'Hearn; pas/pdablake3.pas is a Pascal implementation checked
against the official test vectors (pas/tests/kat.txt).

Test documents
--------------

The files in tests/doc are made from nothing by scripts/mksamples.py and
hold no third-party content.
